                        "entry_id": "7990a9ff-cf4a-3d88-9cf3-71e516af6435",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The stone memorial in Israel erected by Samuel."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "76590402-03c5-4730-b99d-7ef032c05ad3",
                                "sense_id": "2d8bdda6-f422-38da-affc-48352f1917cf",
                                "text": "Then Samuel tooke a ſtone, and ſet it betweene Mizpeh and Shen, and called the name of it Eben-Ezer, ſaying, Hitherto hath the Lord helped vs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e5131a22-656d-42cb-9e92-597ed2e233d9",
                                "sense_id": "2d8bdda6-f422-38da-affc-48352f1917cf",
                                "text": "Here I raiſe my Eben-ezer,\nHither by thy Grace I'm come;\nSo I hope by thy good Pleaſure,\nShortly to arrive at Home:"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
