                                "sense_id": "44c1ccfd-d65e-3eac-8d23-54bd1fc610c5",
                                "text": "\"I have none to give,\" the Ghost replied. \"It comes from other regions, Ebenezer Scrooge, and is conveyed by other ministers, to other kinds of men.\""
